
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Free Horror Games</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    background: #080808;
    color: #e6e6e6;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    padding: 30px 15px;
}

.horror-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: auto;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #3b1111;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(180, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.horror-header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0000, #350000, #080808);
    padding: 45px 25px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #8b0000;
}

.horror-header h1 {
    color: #ff2424;
    font-size: 38px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px #8b0000;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.horror-header p {
    color: #c9c9c9;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

.horror-content {
    padding: 30px;
}

.horror-content h2 {
    color: #ff4040;
    margin: 25px 0 12px;
    font-size: 24px;
    border-left: 4px solid #b30000;
    padding-left: 12px;
}

.horror-content p {
    color: #c4c4c4;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.game-list {
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 15px;
}

.game-card {
    background: #1b1b1b;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.game-card:hover {
    border-color: #ff2929;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.game-card h3 {
    color: #ff5555;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 19px;
}

.game-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    margin: 0;
}

.horror-note {
    background: #240909;
    border-left: 4px solid #ff2929;
    padding: 18px;
    margin: 25px 0;
    border-radius: 5px;
    color: #ddd;
    line-height: 1.8;
}

.horror-button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 16px 35px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff2525, #8b0000);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 17px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.3);
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.horror-button:hover {
    background: #ff0000;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.6);
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

.horror-footer {
    background: #080808;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 13px;
    border-top: 1px solid #333;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .horror-header h1 {
        font-size: 29px;
    }

    .horror-content {
        padding: 20px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="horror-container">

    <div class="horror-header">
        <h1>FREE HORROR GAMES</h1>
        <p>Enter the Darkness. Face Your Fears. Survive the Night.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="horror-content">

