        <h2>Popular Types of Free Horror Games</h2>

        <div class="game-list">

            <div class="game-card">
                <h3>Survival Horror</h3>
                <p>
                    Find resources, avoid dangerous enemies, and stay alive
                    in frightening environments.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="game-card">
                <h3>Psychological Horror</h3>
                <p>
                    Experience mind-bending stories, strange events, and
