            <div class="game-card">
                <h3>Escape Horror</h3>
                <p>
                    Solve puzzles, discover hidden clues, and find your
                    way out of creepy locations.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <h2>Why Play Free Horror Games?</h2>

        <p>
            Free horror games are a great choice for gamers who want
