        </p>

        <div class="horror-note">
            <strong>Ready for the nightmare?</strong><br>
            Explore more gaming information, discover exciting titles,
            and find your next horror adventure.
        </div>

        <h2>Start Your Horror Adventure</h2>

        <p>
            Turn off the lights, put on your headphones, and prepare
            yourself for a chilling gaming experience. The darkness
            is waiting!
        </p>

        <center>
            <a href="http://pcsetup.click/"
               class="horror-button"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer">
               Get More Information
            </a>
        </center>

    </div>

    <div class="horror-footer">
        Explore Gaming • Discover New Adventures • Enjoy the Fear
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
